{"server":"tw","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_06_beg","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_06","title":"舊日碾軋","storyCode":"IS-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c644957ca511e7b345b76f04c3b974413039add0764aafabf91b1b43bda8072d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"為這場演出所做的所有準備都已經完畢，好戲將要開場。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少爺，您沒事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做了個夢而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然不能在沙發上睡覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領已經前往劇院了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要去嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萊昂圖索將身體陷入沙發之中，沒有回答。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅塞蒂，喬萬娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜，你我之間最初的約定，是為貝洛內贏得最後的勝利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我改變了主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你能完成這件事，你就不再欠貝洛內任何東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屆時，你可以自由地離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以狼之主扎羅的獠牙身份向你保證。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"從日落時回到住處開始，直到旭日東昇。\n聽著雨聲，德克薩斯一邊擦拭著自己的佩劍，一邊閱讀著送到自己手上的劇本——《德克薩斯之死》。\n故事曲折動人，並且與她所知的相差不大。\n她隱隱有種預感。\n但首先，她要讓自己的劍更加鋒利。\n今天，她的劍或許需要比平時更快一點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，明明在下雨，太陽倒還是挺刺眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"監獄裡的伙食還挺好的，建議你們也嘗試一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實不錯，我以前還給他們提過幾次建議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請上車吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以不參加嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殺一個哥倫比亞人而已，用得著這麼大張旗鼓嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺說，切利尼娜也會參加。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼安排？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她會喬裝成劇團的成員，在演出開始後，見機行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......那我的演出服呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺的意思是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請您在觀眾席隨機應變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵，呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不解風情的老東西，他人呢，難道他想找個好位置自己看戲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺另外有事，他要去見一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見一個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，一個洗車工。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g8_srcroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，空，我就知道你會在卡特琳娜小姐的工作室裡練習。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是不反對啦，但是，還是提前去劇院化妝準備演出比較好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，說的也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使已經去買早飯了，我們正好去和她會合吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，之前我們不是說要辦個歡迎會迎接能天使的姐姐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"現在都不知道能不能趕得上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"可頌，當心腳下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？哎呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事，被絆了一跤而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，這一摞書都弄倒了，我收拾一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？好像掉出來幾張照片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"照片？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這是一張很多年前的照片。\n空勉強能夠辨認出，背景應該是多年以前的哥倫比亞街頭，繁華又寬闊。\n站在照片中央的，是一位中年男子，他的表情和藹，卻帶著讓人無法輕視的魄力。\n他的左右兩邊，站著一個魯珀女孩和一個菲林女孩。\n左邊的有著一頭秀麗的金髮，表情明快，一眼就能看出性格十分開朗。\n而右邊的則有著一頭黑髮，臉上沒有表情，讓人看不出心裡到底在想什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，這張照片上的，是不是......小時候的德克薩斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後站在她旁邊的，是卡特琳娜小姐？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看照片的背後......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"照片的背後寫著一行字，“喬萬娜與切利尼娜，攝於1080”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬萬娜，這難道是卡特琳娜小姐的真名？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"喬萬娜......喬萬娜·羅塞蒂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這家店開多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五年，巧了，我有條看門牙獸也走失了五年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道，它現在過得還好不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這座城市這麼大，總有活下去的法子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前一直不明白，我給它餵的肉也夠多，窩也夠好，它有什麼不滿意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說，它其實是吃素的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也有可能，它只是真正開過一次葷之後，才知道，平時吃的肉有多難吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難吃的肉......不如不吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的車洗好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洗車手藝不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"熟能生巧罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你總是能把手上的事情做好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，大廈將傾，丹布朗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也該換換口味了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我會考慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好想想，想通了，隨時可以回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你就是臨時替補貝斯手的人嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯？你的髮色，是天生的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真稀奇啊，其他人演貝斯手這個角色都是要染的，這個髮色和瞳色據說和德克薩斯這個家族有血緣關係的人才會有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且仔細一看，你的眉眼......和薩爾瓦多雷也有點像，你難道是他們的私生子之類的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，我和德克薩斯無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，也會有這樣的巧合呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來，坐下吧，你的底子很好，應該不用太麻煩就能給你化好妝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"narration","text":"劇院包廂"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇場經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"請問，您對這個位置滿意嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，視野不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇場經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇場經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您有什麼需要，請隨時喊我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦拉赫，你不留下一起看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，我對這一類的東西向來不感冒，還是去給你拿幾支好酒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白蘭地，我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我來晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事，大家都還在準備呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"坐吧，我先給你化好妝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，你的臉色不太好，是太緊張了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，空你這麼努力，大家一定會喜歡你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"樂團的貝斯手好像突然生病沒法出演了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，那怎麼辦？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別急，總監臨時找到了演員，現在正在另一間化妝室化妝呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臨時找到的......真的沒問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"相信總監的眼光吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說起來，總監今天沒有來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"總監剛剛來過，吩咐了一些事情，然後就離開了，好像是要見一位客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大人物就是這麼忙碌的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，空，你只要做好你能做的部分就可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"場務人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，這不是法官閣下嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"場務人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您有好一陣子沒來了吧，您也是來看今天上演的歌舞劇的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，我只是路過罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"場務人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊，但是現在上演的是備受期待的《德克薩斯之死》，您一定會喜歡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我沒有心情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"場務人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，期待您下次的光臨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（丹布朗？他怎麼會來這裡？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（難道說......他聽從了我的建議，想要來劇院放鬆一下？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但是，今天的劇院......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"場務人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說，您改變主意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我一張票。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"narration","text":"劇院包廂"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領，有人想要見您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是食品安全部部長盧比奧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請他進來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多閣下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡，叫我總監就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好的，好的，能見到您十分榮幸，總監閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坐吧，盧比奧部長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先看劇，我們再聊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"報幕人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"女士們，先生們，歡迎前來觀看由白日劇團帶來的精彩演出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"報幕人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"由卡特琳娜女士撰寫的《德克薩斯之死》，第二幕的演出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"報幕人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"薩爾瓦多雷的故事，想必每個敘拉古人都耳熟能詳，然而，真正瞭解其中那些細節的人又有多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"報幕人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"對德克薩斯家族有著深入瞭解的卡特琳娜女士，為我們提供了一個平實且細緻的視角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"報幕人","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓我們在此處，一同瞭解那位薩爾瓦多雷的一生吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"化妝師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"空，加油。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那我去了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......終於找到我們的位置了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是空，給我們留的位置視野真好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空畢竟被賦予厚望了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，能讓一下嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩科塔的小姑娘......在敘拉古可真少見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......你也是薩科塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來到沃爾西尼這麼久，我也是第一次見到同族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，看來，今天還真是好事連連。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過去吧，孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，我從他身上感覺不到任何情緒，他是離群的薩科塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，他和我見過的離群薩科塔，又不太一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。說起來，你有沒有覺得，今天劇院裡那種一看就是家族裡來的人有點多啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽人說，好像是因為，羅塞蒂家族的首領來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，那不就是你剛才說的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不過，現在還是先看演出吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唱）那是一個混亂與機遇並存的時代，有的人被時代的浪潮吞沒，而有的人，則站在了時代的先端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唱）暴力與財富，權力與秩序，成功者用什麼來交換？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唱）一個敘拉古人踏上了哥倫比亞的土地，帶著野心，傷痕和苦難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唱）故事再次開始，女士們先生們，請看看吧，時代由誰掌管。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個歌聲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，你是來接她的嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你真的做得到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士們，先生們，就讓演出正式開始吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒想到，真的是你，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克薩斯在一瞬間看向包廂其中之一。\n她知道，貝納爾多正坐在那裡俯視著一切。\n她心中了然。\n無論是巧合，亦或者是某種必然，空在這一刻既是危險的，又是安全的。\n一切取決於她。\n觀眾席中的異動，遠處隱約傳來的微響，都在宣告著刺殺的開始。\n她向空做了個噤聲的動作，然後，撥動了手中的琴弦。\n好戲開場。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]}]}
